Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.5. Tree tensor networks", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d46b59c5-c0cf-4dfc-a859-1ecf6918add4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Tree tensor networks (",
 StyleBox["\"TTN\"", "Code"],
 ") build hierarchical topologies \[LongDash] bonds branch outward from a \
single root through successive layers, with no horizontal connections between \
siblings. They naturally represent states with a coarse-graining structure \
and are common in chemistry-oriented TN methods. Specify ",
 StyleBox["depth", "Code"],
 " (number of layers from root to leaves), bond dimension, and ",
 StyleBox["branching", "Code"],
 " (number of children per node)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2969127c-75e7-41f0-9a93-7799098298fa"],

