Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6.4. The annotated graph form", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"534003d5-f941-4c27-a24b-0e32f6348921"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Finally, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["ToTensorNetworkGraph",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/ToTensorNetworkGraph"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"fda3c2fd-7791-4ca5-8010-9ae33352bf7c"],
 " returns the network as an annotated ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Graph",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/Graph"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"c305d375-b131-4c6f-a58c-ce3d00187d35"],
 " object. The graph form carries tensors as vertex annotations, bonds as \
labelled directed edges, and indices as both vertex and edge annotations. \
Because it is a genuine ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Graph",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/Graph"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"ef8ebedc-c870-4ca1-b379-f9d81c04fd0d"],
 ", it accepts the full graph API \[LongDash] you can call ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["VertexList",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/VertexList"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"65b06740-17de-43a7-b224-879b27977e12"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["EdgeList",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/EdgeList"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"1ec51597-7c63-4feb-9583-e730b0b78842"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["GraphPlot",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/GraphPlot"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3062a10a-407f-4c4c-8e04-4b1bfe75e65e"],
 ", run graph algorithms, and visualize the topology. Several transformations \
including ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkReplaceIndices",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->
    "paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkReplaceIndices"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"2f44b2d8-a664-4ecc-972c-e2fdcbf3d62c"],
 " consume this form directly. Use ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkGraphData",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkGraphData"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"b8450756-f397-4a4a-b402-3c356c7c4325"],
 " to extract the same property association as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkData",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkData"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"165dd667-8781-4d7c-a537-41c63862e20c"],
 " from the graph form, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkGraphQ",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkGraphQ"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"da028e9b-63ed-46e5-9d89-974b60708abf"],
 " to test for it."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a6f11efe-f04d-4052-8839-1231be8f211f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7. Cycles and visualizations", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"62e649eb-ce2b-470d-9c06-a9b6a4723b6b"],

Cell["\<\
Two transformations that operate on the annotated graph form fall outside the \
basic edit-and-rename workflow of section 6: cycle breaking and \
index-connectivity extraction. Cycle breaking is required whenever a network \
contains a closed loop \[LongDash] for instance, a chain with periodic \
boundary conditions \[LongDash] because sequential pairwise contraction \
cannot reduce a cycle without first opening it. Index-connectivity extraction \
collapses the network down to its bond structure alone, useful for inspecting \
how indices share tensors without the data getting in the way.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a24a5588-484c-4b2c-a9ed-b69843486803"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7.1. Breaking cycles with TensorNetworkRemoveCycles", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"ecbfad57-1941-4d78-af1b-2b2ccb0df45b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A directed-graph tensor network with a cycle (for example, three rank-2 \
tensors wired ",
 StyleBox["1 \[Rule] 2 \[Rule] 3 \[Rule] 1", "Code"],
 ") cannot be reduced by sequential pairwise contraction without first being \
broken. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkRemoveCycles",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->
    "paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkRemoveCycles"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"399d3e65-29d8-4a2e-8082-74eb465dc838"],
 " walks the cycle list and, for each cycle, inserts a cup-and-cap pair of \
identity tensors: the cup duplicates one bond at the start of the loop and \
the cap closes the duplicate at the end. The resulting acyclic graph \
contracts to exactly the same tensor (or scalar) as the closed-loop original \
because the inserted identities act as the trace that the cycle was already \
implicitly performing. This is the internal mechanism that makes ",
 StyleBox["\"Boundary\" -> \"Periodic\"", "Code"],
 " MPS, MPO, and PEPS networks sequentially contractible."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26c6f905-dda4-4a20-8b29-ce0bfb035e7f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Build a cyclic three-tensor network manually as an annotated directed ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Graph",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Graph"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3d243f83-8be8-4e94-835f-eaee2807d10a"],
 ". Each vertex carries a 2\[Times]2 matrix and exposes two indices; the \
three directed edges close the loop."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5cb89488-361e-467b-9aa7-86f2ec349906"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"M1", "=", 
   RowBox[{"RandomReal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"M2", "=", 
   RowBox[{"RandomReal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"M3", "=", 
   RowBox[{"RandomReal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[76]:=",ExpressionUUID->"73b74210-0403-4aca-aa65-7322ac10807a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"cyclic", "=", 
  RowBox[{"Graph", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"DirectedEdge", "[", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Superscript", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"DirectedEdge", "[", 
       RowBox[{"2", ",", "3", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Superscript", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
           RowBox[{"3", ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"DirectedEdge", "[", 
       RowBox[{"3", ",", "1", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Superscript", "[", 
           RowBox[{"3", ",", "2"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"AnnotationRules", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"1", "\[Rule]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<Tensor\>\"", "\[Rule]", "M1"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Index\>\"", "\[Rule]", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Superscript", "[", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"2", "\[Rule]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<Tensor\>\"", "\[Rule]", "M2"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Index\>\"", "\[Rule]", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
              RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Superscript", "[", 
              RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"3", "\[Rule]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<Tensor\>\"", "\[Rule]", "M3"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Index\>\"", "\[Rule]", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
              RowBox[{"3", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Superscript", "[", 
              RowBox[{"3", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
      "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[77]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ee91857d-0531-4a04-8f94-574d8577ecc0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 GraphicsBox[
  NamespaceBox["NetworkGraphics",
