Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
After cycle removal the graph is acyclic and FindCycle returns the empty \
list. Two extra vertices (the cup and the cap) have been inserted:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"791be124-657a-4075-968e-e1991fbd1744"],

